  <tr><td>workspace_action_items</td><td>text, priority (critical/high/medium/low), status (todo/in_progress/done), source (ai/manual)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>workspace_divergence_events</td><td>topic, positions (jsonb), divergence_score — logged when agents meaningfully disagree (tension &gt; 50)</td></tr>
</table>
